  "idea": "Zapier transfer tool for bulk migrating legacy spreadsheet data",
  "text": "This built-in Zapier tool handles one-time database imports effortlessly without burning automation tasks. Founders build recurring zaps to move old records, accidentally consuming thousands of expensive task credits. Standard live automation triggers are designed for new events, not historical bulk transfers. Instead, use Zapier Transfer to review, select, and batch-migrate legacy records into Airtable with one click. Your new database launches instantly while protecting your monthly budget.",
